[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0551","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0551.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0702","title":"HP HP-UX 11.00 net.init RC 脚本符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.0 系统中的 net.init RC 脚本（S008net.init）存在符号链接攻击漏洞。该脚本以 root 权限运行时会在 /tmp 目录下创建 stcp.conf 临时文件，且未对文件路径进行安全校验。本地攻击者可通过预先创建指向任意系统文件的符号链接 /tmp/stcp.conf，诱导脚本写入操作覆盖目标文件内容，从而实现权限提升或破坏系统关键配置。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0702"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:18Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 HP-UX 系统至 11.11（11i）或更高版本，该版本已修复 net.init 脚本中不安全的临时文件创建问题。如无法升级，可手动修改 /sbin/init.d/net.init 脚本，将创建 /tmp/stcp.conf 的方式改为使用 mktemp 命令生成随机临时文件名，避免使用固定路径。同时限制本地非授权用户对 /tmp 目录的写入权限，或移除 S008net.init 脚本的 setuid 位以降低提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0261.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1602","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5131","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20162","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0702.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0702.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0702","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0702.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0702.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0702.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-0702.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0702.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0702.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0702.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0551.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0551.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0551.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0550","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0550.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0699","title":"HP HP-UX FTPD 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.20 系统的 FTP 守护进程（ftpd）存在格式化字符串漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 PASS 命令发送特制的格式化字符串触发该漏洞。该漏洞源于 ftpd 在处理用户输入时未正确过滤格式化字符串标记，导致攻击者可读取或写入任意内存地址。成功利用此漏洞可导致远程代码执行或拒绝服务，完全控制目标系统。CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0699"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:17Z","remediation":"立即安装 HP 官方针对此漏洞发布的安全补丁（HP Security Bulletin 相关补丁包），将 HP-UX 系统升级至 11.00 及以上版本以彻底修复 ftpd 格式化字符串漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 FTP 服务（inetd 中注释 ftp 行并重启 inetd），或通过防火墙限制对 TCP 21 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，同时监控 FTP 日志中的异常 PASS 命令请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0028.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1560","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/212","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0699.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0699.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0699","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0699.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0699.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0699.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9841ac21d9bcdb7f48d8ef999473e1abd131d5fe/2000/CVE-2000-0699.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aaacad1562c685f186ef7d9e0567254ada70ff63/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0699.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0699.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0699.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0550.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0549","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0549.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0698","title":"Minicom Capture-file 符号链接攻击本地提权漏洞","description":"Minicom 1.82.1 及更早版本在部分 Linux 系统中存在符号链接攻击漏洞。minicom 以 setgid uucp 权限运行，在创建捕获文件时未正确检查文件路径的符号链接，本地低权限用户可通过构造符号链接诱使 minicom 在 uucp 组属主权限下创建任意文件，从而实现本地权限提升或文件篡改。该漏洞影响运行 minicom 1.82.1 及之前版本的 Linux 系统，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需额外认证即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0698"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:17Z","remediation":"升级 Minicom 至 2.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可执行 `chmod g-s /usr/bin/minicom` 移除 setgid uucp 权限位，或限制仅受信任用户使用 minicom 命令，防止本地低权限用户通过符号链接攻击创建 uucp 组属主的任意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/77361","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1599","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5151","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20160","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0698.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0698.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0698","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0698.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0698.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9841ac21d9bcdb7f48d8ef999473e1abd131d5fe/2000/CVE-2000-0698.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aaacad1562c685f186ef7d9e0567254ada70ff63/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0698.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0698.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0698.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0698.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0549.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0547","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0547.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0697","title":"Sun Solaris AnswerBook2 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Solaris AnswerBook2 的 dwhttpd Web 服务器管理接口存在命令注入漏洞，由于未对用户输入中的 shell 元字符进行有效过滤，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向管理接口发送特制 HTTP 请求，在服务器上以 dwhttpd 进程权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞可导致攻击者完全控制目标系统，实现信息窃取、权限提升或后续横向移动。攻击条件简单，仅需目标系统开放 AnswerBook2 服务端口且可网络访问，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0697"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:17Z","remediation":"立即停止使用并移除 Solaris AnswerBook2 服务，该产品已停止维护多年，不再有安全补丁支持。如业务仍需使用，应彻底禁用 dwhttpd Web 服务管理接口，在防火墙上限制对 AnswerBook2 端口（通常为 8888/TCP）的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接，并对管理接口实施强身份认证和访问控制列表。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/sun/2000-q3/0001.html","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2000/Aug/0105.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5058.php","http://www.s21sec.com/en/avisos/s21sec-004-en.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1556","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20146","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0697.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0697.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0697.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0697","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0697.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0697.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0697.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6803c56f209ac0b3251a2751d06e0a641b57c323/2000/CVE-2000-0697.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0697.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0697.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0547.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0547.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0547.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0546","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0546.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0696","title":"Sun Solaris AnswerBook2 管理接口认证绕过漏洞","description":"Solaris AnswerBook2 的 dwhttpd Web 服务器管理接口未对 CGI 脚本进行正确的身份验证检查，远程攻击者无需认证即可直接调用 /cgi-bin/admin/admin 脚本，通过构造特定参数（如 command=add_user）添加管理账户，从而获取管理界面访问权限。该漏洞允许攻击者读取日志文件、管理内容，影响 Solaris 系统上 AnswerBook2 1.4.4 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0696"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:17Z","remediation":"立即安装 Sun 安全公告 #00196 提供的补丁：SPARC 平台安装 110011-02，x86 平台安装 110012-02，并将 AnswerBook2 升级至 v1.4.2 或更高版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面限制对 8888 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并禁用 /cgi-bin/admin/admin CGI 脚本的执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/sun/2000-q3/0001.html","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2000/Aug/0105.html","http://www.s21sec.com/en/avisos/s21sec-004-en.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1554","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5069","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20144","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0696.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0696","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0696.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0696.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0696.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6803c56f209ac0b3251a2751d06e0a641b57c323/2000/CVE-2000-0696.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0696.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0696.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0696.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-0696.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0546.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0546.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0546.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0543","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0543.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0695","title":"Tech-Source Raptor GFX PGX32 配置工具缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Tech-Source Raptor GFX PGX32 配置工具 pgxconfig 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。pgxconfig 程序在处理命令行参数时未对输入长度进行充分边界检查，本地攻击者可通过向 pgxconfig 传递超长特制命令行选项触发栈缓冲区溢出，覆盖函数返回地址，从而劫持程序执行流程。成功利用后攻击者可以获取目标系统的 root 或 SYSTEM 级别权限。攻击条件为攻击者需拥有目标系统的本地 shell 访问权限，无需任何额外认证。该漏洞影响 Raptor GFX PGX32 2.3.1 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0695"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:17Z","remediation":"建议立即移除 pgxconfig 的 setuid 权限位：`chmod u-s /usr/sbin/pgxconfig`，仅允许受信任的 root 用户执行该工具。如业务需要普通用户使用，可通过 sudo 配置精细化授权（如 `Cmnd_Alias RAPTOR=/usr/sbin/pgxconfig`），避免以 root 权限直接运行。同时升级到厂商修复版本（PGX32 2.3.1 之后），或联系 Tech-Source 获取补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0463.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20147","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0695.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0695.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0695","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0695.json","https://github.com