复杂度低，可导致目标系统完全失陷，包括数据窃取、恶意软件植入等严重后果。目前已有公开的 Exploit-DB 利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0690"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 Auction Weaver CGI 脚本（auction.pl），或升级到已修复此漏洞的最新版本。如业务必须使用，需在脚本入口处对 fromfile 参数进行严格过滤，禁止传入 `;&|`$(){}` 等 shell 元字符，并限制脚本仅允许特定用户通过 .htaccess 访问。建议迁移至其他仍在维护的拍卖系统。作为网络层缓解措施，可在 WAF 或反向代理上配置规则拦截包含 shell 元字符的 fromfile 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0370.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0452.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20194","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0690.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0690.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0690","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0690.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0690.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0690.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81f67ee2f2329d45fd70316a977698f2177074cc/2000/CVE-2000-0690.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0690.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0690.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0690.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0541.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0541.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0541.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0539","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0539.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0689","title":"CGI Script Center Account Manager 1.0 认证绕过漏洞","description":"CGI Script Center Account Manager 1.0 LITE/PRO 的管理密码更改功能存在身份验证缺失漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何认证，可直接调用 amadmin.pl 脚本并传入 setpasswd 参数，即可任意修改管理员密码，从而获取 Account Manager 的管理权限。该漏洞影响 Account Manager LITE 及 PRO 版本，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，可导致敏感信息泄露、权限提升及系统被篡改。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0689"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16Z","remediation":"厂商 CGI Script Center 已停止维护 Account Manager 产品线，建议立即停止使用 Account Manager LITE/PRO，迁移至其他受支持的账户管理方案。临时缓解措施包括：在 Web 服务器层面限制 amadmin.pl 的访问 IP 白名单，移除或重命名 amadmin.pl 脚本，或在脚本中添加管理员会话验证逻辑以防止未授权调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0291.html","http://www.cgiscriptcenter.com/acctlite/","http://www.osvdb.org/13341","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1604","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5125","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20165","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0689.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0689.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0689","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0689.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0689.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6627fbe158e9fca31f355d5243a197fbe6b8a60c/2000/CVE-2000-0689.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0689.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0689.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0689.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-0689.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0539.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0539.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0539.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0538","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0538.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0688","title":"CGI Script Center Subscribe Me Lite 2.0 管理密码未授权修改漏洞","description":"CGI Script Center 开发的 Subscribe Me Lite 2.0 邮件列表管理 CGI 程序存在认证绕过漏洞。该程序在调用 subscribe.pl 脚本处理管理员密码修改请求时，未对请求来源进行身份验证，任何远程攻击者无需登录即可直接向 subscribe.pl 发送带有 setpwd 参数的 POST 请求，任意设置管理员密码。成功利用后攻击者可获取 Account Manager 完全管理权限，包括添加、删除邮件列表订阅用户以及修改系统配置。攻击条件简单，仅需目标服务器运行 Subscribe Me Lite 2.0 且 CGI 脚本可被外部访问，无需任何前置认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0688"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护且厂商已不存在，建议立即停止使用 Subscribe Me Lite，迁移至其他受支持的邮件列表管理软件（如 Mailman、Sympa）。如无法立即替换，可在 Web 服务器层面限制对 subscribe.pl 的访问（如仅允许特定 IP 或添加认证），并移除 setpwd 参数的处理逻辑。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0292.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96722957421029&w=2","http://www.cgiscriptcenter.com/subscribe/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1607","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20177","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0688.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0688.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0688","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0688.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0688.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8fb1620294bff0cde2c82bba8543a916d4f0215c/2000/CVE-2000-0688.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0688.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0688.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0688.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0688.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0538.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0538.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0538.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0537","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0537.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0685","title":"BEA WebLogic PageCompileServlet 未授权访问致远程命令执行漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic 5.1.x 的 PageCompileServlet 未正确限制访问权限，导致远程攻击者可直接调用该 Servlet 编译并执行任意 Java JHTML 代码。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需通过网络向目标服务器发送特制请求即可触发该漏洞，实现远程代码执行，完全控制服务器。该漏洞影响 BEA WebLogic 5.1.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Oracle 已在后续版本中修复此问题，建议升级至不受影响版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0685"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15Z","remediation":"升级到 BEA WebLogic 5.1.x 的补丁版本（参考 BEA 安全公告 security_000731），限制 PageCompileServlet 的访问权限，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 访问该 Servlet，并在 Web 服务器层禁用对 *.jhtml 文件的直接请求和编译功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0434.html","http://developer.bea.com/alerts/security_000731.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1525","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20125","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0685.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0685.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0685","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0685.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0685.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6db804ac9380f31f71f86be4f4f8d98e65f04ec3/2000/CVE-2000-0685.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0685.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0685.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0685.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0685.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0537.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0537.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0537.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0536","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0536.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0684","title":"BEA WebLogic JSPServlet 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic 5.1.x 版本存在 JSPServlet 访问控制缺陷，未对 JSPServlet 的访问权限进行严格限制。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过直接调用 JSPServlet 对任意源文件进行编译并执行 Java JSP 代码。由于该 Servlet 允许对服务器上的源文件进行编译执行，攻击者可利用此漏洞在目标系统上执行任意恶意代码，进而完全控制服务器。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，属于最高危级别，影响 WebLogic 5.1.x 全部版本。攻击者仅需能够访问 WebLogic 服务器的 HTTP 端口即可触发，无需任何特殊条件或认证凭据。建议立即升级 WebLogic 至安全版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0684"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15Z","remediation":"立即安装 BEA Systems 2000 年 7 月 31 日发布的安全补丁（参见 http://developer.bea.com/alerts/security_000731.html）。若无法获取原厂补丁，可在 WebLogic 5.1.x 的 web.xml 中为 JSPServlet 添加 <security-constraint> 配置，限制仅允许受信任的内部 IP 访问 /jsp/ 路径。同时升级至受支持的 Oracle WebLogic Server 版本（如 14c 或更高），因为 WebLogic 5.1.x 已于 2004 年终止支持。作为临时缓解措施，在网络边界防火墙上阻断外部对 JSP 页面的直接 HTTP 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0434.html","http://developer.bea.com/alerts/security_000731.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1525","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20081","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0684.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0684.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0684","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0684.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0684.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09e0eb937d6858d58d5e2a369c15112b42549508/2000/CVE-2000-0684.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0684.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0684.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0684.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0684.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0536.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0536.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0536.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0534","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0534.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0680","title":"CVS Kit CVS Server 1.10.8 Checkin.prog 任意程序创建漏洞","description":"CVS 1.10.8 版本服务器存在访问控制缺陷，未对用户创建 Checkin.prog 或 Update.prog 程序进行充分限制。拥有 CVS 提交权限的远程攻击者可利用该漏洞，在服务器上创建或植入特洛伊木马程序，随后通过执行 CVS commit 操作触发这些程序的自动执行，从而在目标系统上以 CVS 服务器进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 CVS 1.10.8 及可能更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。目前已存在公开的利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0680"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15Z","remediation":"立即升级 CVS 服务器至 1.11.x 或更高版本（该漏洞在 1.11 中已修复）。如无法升级，在 CVSROOT 配置文件中移除或注释掉 Checkin.prog 和 Update.prog 功能，并限制仅信任用户拥有 CVSROOT 目录写入权限。同时建议通过 SSH 隧道封装 CVS pserver 通信，避免远程未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1524","http://www.securityfocus.com/frames/?content=/templates/archive.pike%3Flist%3D1%26msg%3Dhvou2daoebb.fsf%40serein.m17n.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20108","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0680.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0680.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0680","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0680.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0680.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0680.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5fdf468f2fb873a7503bb1902a9b5f49d74e59db/2000/CVE-2000-0680.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0680.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0680.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0680.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0534.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0533","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0533.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0679","title":"CVS CVS Server 1.10.8 任意文件创建漏洞","description":"CVS 1.10.8 客户端存在路径名信任漏洞，CVS 服务器可向客户端发送特制的路径名信息，由于客户端未对服务器返回的路径名进行充分校验，攻击者可通过控制恶意 CVS 服务器诱导连接客户端在本地创建任意文件。该漏洞攻击条件要求用户主动连接恶意 CVS 服务器，影响 CVS 1.10.8 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0679"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15Z","remediation":"升级到 CVS 1.11 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。避免连接不可信的 CVS 服务器，对服务器返回的路径名进行严格校验。建议使用 SSH 隧道等加密通道连接 CVS 服务器，防止中间人攻击篡改路径名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1523","http://www.securityfocus.com/frames/?content=/templates/archive.pike%3F