Z","remediation":"升级 Netscape Communicator 至 4.75 或更高版本，或完全禁用 Java applet 支持（在 Preferences → Advanced 中取消 Enable Java 选项）。如无法升级，建议更换为现代浏览器（如 Firefox、Chrome）以避免此漏洞风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0019.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0115.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0236.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0265.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-027.1.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-15.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_60.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-054.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1546","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20140","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0676.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0676","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0676.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0676.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/878a3042444029b151459a1565a690101509a27a/2000/CVE-2000-0676.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0676.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0676.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0676.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0676.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-redhat/blob/11f7040c1ab8cb698a